### Local solver smoke test: start with DEEPSEEK_MODEL='deepseek-flash'.
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/solve
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
Accept: text/plain

Hi. What model are you?

### Direct DeepSeek Flash request: export DEEPSEEK_API_KEY for the IDE HTTP client.
# /chat/completions accepts messages; "deepseek-flash" is the model, not an endpoint.
POST https://api.deepseek.com/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$env.DEEPSEEK_API_KEY}}

{
  "model": "deepseek-flash",
  "messages": [
    {"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant."},
    {"role": "user", "content": "Hello!"}
  ],
  "thinking": {"type": "enabled"},
  "reasoning_effort": "high",
  "stream": false
}
